{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0200_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_01_title", "source_sha256": "8ed034f706afc3b27441f1c883d5fcee688b58f1a001335585b9a1edb065f12e", "ja": "我ら『月兎隊』！", "zh": "我们是“月兔队”！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0200_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "3872a3081defc9f2d0bc6c2eb3ee20921b4640657746045485bac6829437ac8c", "ja": "狙ったお宝は必ず手に入れる『月兎隊』。\n今回は月の宝『ストーンボウル48』を狙い\nオークションに潜入したが、保管庫に\nお目当ての品はなく、警報が作動。多数の\n警備員たちに囲まれてしまうのだった。", "zh": "必定会将看中的宝物收入囊中的“月兔队”。  \n这次她们盯上了月之宝物“石碗48”，  \n潜入了拍卖会，却发现保管库里  \n并没有想要的物品，警报随即响起。她们就这样  \n被众多警卫团团包围了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0200_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_01_1000_052kao", "source_sha256": "808467f3556de60bad4436e83042250a9ea78f8a9baa2a5a783e5400f6501faa", "ja": "現在、この都市で開催されている地下オークション……\n会場にはありとあらゆる宝が集まっています。", "zh": "现在，这座城市正在举办地下拍卖会……\n会场汇集了各种各样的宝物。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0200_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_01_1001_052kao", "source_sha256": "ec36ce676d4004c69dc6ca9111dce9ea73c504fb95daa781599d90df42d976a3", "ja": "きらびやかな宝飾品に歴史的名画、稀書、骨董……\nそして月の宝『ストーンボウル48』……。", "zh": "华丽的珠宝、历史名画、珍稀书籍、古董……\n以及月之宝《石碗48》……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0200_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_01_1002_007ior", "source_sha256": "7cbf81958728695454a7dc60c5403bc6e26b19e0fbcf79ece6ca635fae981681", "ja": "月の宝……。", "zh": "月之宝……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0200_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_01_1003_052kao", "source_sha256": "26127c0b600704644b3ecb76cd83ee4b8f22262a5c884afc18908c4a10b339b8", "ja": "はい。月から漂着した、\n比肩しうるもののない本物の宝です。", "zh": "是的。这是从月亮上漂来的、世间无可比拟的真正宝物。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0200_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_01_1004_052kao", "source_sha256": "f860626068d74193dc2f1a0dec7391c485c64c1aca5567e014449340a34e69d0", "ja": "『輝きのダイヤ』同様、イデアルお嬢様が\n手にするには、相応しいものかと。", "zh": "正如《闪耀的钻石》一样，想来也是适合由イデアル大小姐亲手拿着的东西。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0200_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_01_1005_007ior", "source_sha256": "1edbc5f42988dbfa862d0abd96a9ee4cf795b090a9216c9706ca26b73b637023", "ja": "作戦の際は名前でなく、コードネームで\n呼ぶようにと言ったはずよ？　ミス・W。", "zh": "我不是说过，作战时要用代号称呼，而不是叫名字吗？W小姐。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0200_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_01_1006_052kao", "source_sha256": "fb9e88ca50643c4632ac2e2bcc0ea7585810d6abed10fb8440b8e6e2220b4f1e", "ja": "失礼しました。\nコードネーム、レディ・I。", "zh": "失礼了。\n代号，Lady I。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0200_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_01_1007_007ior", "source_sha256": "e315a405f7464bb1881174d5d0f3e7536bd182c1d64188d3494c60556ef0a793", "ja": "よろしい。というわけで……私たちが狙うのは、\n月の宝『ストーンボウル48』よ！", "zh": "很好。那么……我们要瞄准的就是，\n月亮的宝物『石碗48』！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0200_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_01_1008_042miy", "source_sha256": "155c6ecc5e4053d983e685958d261613e63f5fbc8c5bb592dde9fb1944eea963", "ja": "オークションのお宝を盗むとは、大胆不敵な～。\n流石は、イデアルお嬢様です～。", "zh": "竟然要偷走拍卖会上的宝物，真是胆大包天啊～。不愧是伊德阿尔小姐～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0200_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_01_1009_042miy", "source_sha256": "b70464a64d52e450e10bf056a6901912b410d4f67c2f56d123d7a9b228037b53", "ja": "競り負けたものは、盗んででも手に入れる……\n見事な発想の転換ですな～。", "zh": "竞价失败的东西，就算偷也要弄到手……真是漂亮的思路转换呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0200_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_01_1010_049mom", "source_sha256": "b8a0e73bd58c239c6d96657f94c1f078d65dc177aa353c81e029f3b848d3cdfe", "ja": "むしろ、カッコ悪くない？　大財閥のご令嬢が\n地下オークションで競り負けて、裏で強盗計画なんて。", "zh": "反而很逊吧？大财阀家的千金在地下拍卖会上竞价失败，居然还要在背后策划抢劫。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0200_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_01_1011_007ior", "source_sha256": "21e691e62dfb79aff30aec116b54b4331f0226208e0abcdec0dab6c8aee8cadb", "ja": "うるさいわよ、リトル！　ディーディーも、\nリーダーの言うことにケチつけるんじゃないの！", "zh": "吵死啦，小不点！迪迪也是，\n少来对首领说的话挑三拣四！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0200_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_01_1012_007ior", "source_sha256": "0908a8e33629cbb6dadbd7b489f08dfd5a3885bccedf48c03e56ffdc94948397", "ja": "狙ったお宝はすべからく私の手中に収める！\nここは、そのために私が作った秘密組織……！", "zh": "我看中的宝物，全都要收入囊中！\n这里可是我为此创建的秘密组织……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0200_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_01_1013_007ior", "source_sha256": "9c5e11d02cdca602836a100e529b1424f174e04628e262c5b31ec9baf3a5dd6d", "ja": "『月の輝きすらも手に入れる、パーフェクトレディこと\nレディ・Iと、チーム・ラビッツ』なんだから！", "zh": "毕竟可是“连月亮的光辉都能收入囊中的完美女士——Lady I，以及兔兔队”嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0200_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_01_1014_042miy", "source_sha256": "4e8c3e798f6da6bb1ab92714c8cffe98fa74e06e6889b49c3fe4fe53a69c3ebc", "ja": "む～ん……相変わらず、長い名前ですな～。\nちっとも覚えられませんよ～？", "zh": "嗯～……名字还是一如既往地长呢～。\n完全记不住呀～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0200_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_01_1015_049mom", "source_sha256": "e1ea50774111564f146e3e35fe97a2d1843fa8d10d612781dc80731d7b7ef6b1", "ja": "月のお宝を狙うウサギなんだし、\n『月兎（ゲット）隊』でいいんじゃないの？", "zh": "反正是瞄准月亮宝藏的兔子嘛，\n叫『月兔（猎）队』不就好了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0200_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_01_1016_007ior", "source_sha256": "abe12c45bff5f9cec105c014559469b009b360a8d5867405641c5ab74e563f2d", "ja": "いやよ！　そんなの、単純すぎるじゃない。", "zh": "不要！那也太简单了吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0200_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_01_1017_014mir", "source_sha256": "17f8761f113bda7b97859248d41caf8bf00bde75a5f3007b3d3f44232d956a84", "ja": "狙ったお宝は、すべからく私の手中に収める……\nさすがレディ・I先輩です！　ソンケーしちゃいます！", "zh": "凡是看中的宝物，都要收入我的囊中……\n不愧是Lady·I前辈！真让人尊敬！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0200_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_01_1018_007ior", "source_sha256": "f4f1ca6f3ea7fcdedeccd41f64490d3335a9a246aea983c4706c71b4806fc5a2", "ja": "あら、よくわかってるじゃないの新人♪　そろそろ\nあんたにも、コードネームをつけてあげないとよね。", "zh": "哎呀，你还挺懂的嘛，新人♪ 差不多也该\n给你起个代号了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0200_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_01_1019_014mir", "source_sha256": "67dcae4aad2d778e6fd65e51cbcfaa0c74decc4f025d10e2882b26c65427879e", "ja": "えっ、先輩のネーミングセンスには不安が……\nじゃなくて！　私は未熟なので、ナナシで十分です！", "zh": "诶，前辈的命名品味让我有点不安……不对！我还不成熟，叫无名就够了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0200_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_01_1020_007ior", "source_sha256": "29ef35741a7696194f0bf41829dcc6f60e86a65b18506489bdde203fd1c4f314", "ja": "そう？　まあちょうどいいの思いつかないし、\nしばらくはナナシのままね。", "zh": "这样吗？不过我也想不出什么合适的名字，暂时就继续叫无名吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0200_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_01_1021_052kao", "source_sha256": "280e9b8e2c4907d2584acf75d2650489f784b27bb26685d6aeca4500bb0acf6b", "ja": "では、話がまとまったところで、\n具体的な作戦説明とまいりましょう。", "zh": "那么，既然已经商量好了，就来说明一下具体的作战计划吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0200_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_01_1022_null", "source_sha256": "e03d30add8c17eacc77bbfab826604003f1590d593cd48e180ae1ba332364ba0", "ja": "作戦決行　当日……", "zh": "执行作战　当天……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0200_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_01_1023_049mom", "source_sha256": "9ad53f414f4ef940a486dcc977f721054d7f87002f5ee0f5888d58ecd99fc78d", "ja": "ミス・W、聞こえる？　こちらリトル、\n目的地に侵入成功。このまま先行するわ。", "zh": "W小姐，听得到吗？这里是Little。\n成功潜入目的地。我就这样继续先行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0200_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_01_1024_052kao", "source_sha256": "a5ab7812120d3b249c3cc7e9bdaae17f57a16a845e05be1160bc0c35311db7be", "ja": "「こちらW、了解しました。レディ・I、\nディーディー、ナナシは続いてください」", "zh": "“这里是W，收到。莱蒂·I、\n蒂蒂、无名，请跟上。”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0200_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_01_1025_007ior", "source_sha256": "bfe70a50ff49bbb0cc97077440301e20be9ba0f456f2921c9027ae74c68268c8", "ja": "うふふ、どんな厳重な警備を布いたってムダよ！\n上空からの侵入って、防ぎにくいんだから。", "zh": "呵呵，布下再严密的警备也是没用的！\n从空中入侵，可是很难防守的呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0200_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_01_1026_042miy", "source_sha256": "849bb47ac65953b1163f457391190a2849748df2b9d1947f58a5cdc6215499f5", "ja": "所有する飛行機から落下して侵入……大財閥ならでは\nですな～。パラシュートもだいぶ慣れてきました～。", "zh": "从自己拥有的飞机上跳伞潜入……真不愧是大财阀呢～。我也已经相当习惯降落伞了～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0200_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_01_1027_052kao", "source_sha256": "e52fc779c5150a098239441cf951e0a5d3775f8683f40f8705989dc057f33def", "ja": "「しかしレディ・I。今回は、巷を騒がせている例の\n怪盗からも予告状が届いているとのことですが……」", "zh": "「不过，I女士。据说这次连那位最近闹得满城风雨的怪盗也寄来了预告函……」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0200_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_01_1028_007ior", "source_sha256": "f7f68a92fbc14e54d19a96490f57813dd8fccae1e8e511723ccea24ee03e7207", "ja": "ああ、怪盗シャインナイトね……。盗みの腕は\n立つって聞いたけど、もうどこかにいるのかしら？", "zh": "啊，怪盗 Shine Knight 啊……听说她偷东西的本事很厉害，不过该不会已经潜入某处了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0200_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_01_1029_014mir", "source_sha256": "c98d5099a9c46a2544d065b0d27bc4a0689a57a31d11116cb33631126ab700ba", "ja": "まさか～。上空以外からこの会場に\n潜り込む方法なんて、あるわけないですよ～。", "zh": "怎么可能嘛～。除了从空中以外，\n怎么可能还有潜入这个会场的方法呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0200_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_01_1030_049mom", "source_sha256": "67c4886406d5aa581884a70b7d6ef5160b604665be4696214ff7b0fc7059ffe9", "ja": "？　おかしいわ、レディ・I。保管庫はここで\n間違いないはずなのに……宝が確認できない。", "zh": "？奇怪，I女士。保管库应该就是这里没错，可是却确认不到宝藏。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0200_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_01_1031_007ior", "source_sha256": "995ca60414fc60087f67bd07d0bff0f7d1ab9fe4b064cbb90f1269066d522509", "ja": "なんですって？　……本当だわ。お宝の影も形も\n見えない。ということは、もしかして……。", "zh": "什么？……真的耶。连宝物的影子都看不到。也就是说，难道……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0200_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_01_1032_se", "source_sha256": "fc1a2a3149fa0f38956e311e83a9cd31be6567d1657bf9f6f1102a3c58612dda", "ja": "ビーッ！　ビーッ！　ビーッ！　ビーッ！", "zh": "哔——！　哔——！　哔——！　哔——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
